<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4580] extension of knoxJwtRealm does not work with subclasses</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4580</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When using a realm that extends knoxJwtRealm, this does not function with Zeppelin&apos;s REST /api/login as the latter checks for the class name rather than using instanceof:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/0b8423c62ae52f3716d4bb63d60762fee6910788/zeppelin-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/rest/LoginRestApi.java#L173&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/0b8423c62ae52f3716d4bb63d60762fee6910788/zeppelin-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/rest/LoginRestApi.java#L173&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Instead, instanceof should be used.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A patch is attached that has been tested.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
